          "text": "Nejoki ninye, “Nji ejo Olaitoriani, ‘Ore enkaraki ninchoo elo too nkaik inono, ilo tung'ani apa laiteng'elaka enkidaaroto, ore enkaraki ina, keinosieki enkishui ino enkishui enye. Neinosieki enkishui oo ltung'ana linono enkishui oo ltung'ana lenyena.’ ” ",
